# Copy to `.env` to override the app-scoped product-account identifier.
# Optional — by default the identifier is derived from the host (e.g. localhost:5173,
# or a .dot.li gateway URL mapped to its .dot product id). See CLAUDE.md / README.
# VITE_PRODUCT_ACCOUNT_ID=

# Sample network for the chain demo (src/chain.ts). Default: devnet — the
# public products devnet on the Paseo testnet Asset Hub (para 1000). Set to
# paseo-next for the Paseo Next v2 preview network (para 1500; that's what the
# CDM `paseo` preset targets, NOT the Paseo testnet).
# VITE_NETWORK=devnet
